Package: tutorialverse
Title: Describe and Check Interactive R Tutorials
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    c(person("Shaurita D.", "Hutchins",
             email = "sdhutchins@uab.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
      person("Samuel", "Bharti",
             email = "samuelbharti.io@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cph")))
Description: Validates shared metadata and checks source and lesson URLs
    for interactive R tutorials. Provides engine adapters for optional
    rendering of local tutorial copies and structured reports that
    distinguish completed checks from unsupported interactive testing.
